Z||000012||mope||02-01-2001||01:37 PM||||i stripped the clear off the aluminum part, sanded it with medium sand paper, then wet sanded it, then buffed it with a car buffer and rubbing compound. For the grey insert i just used a tooth brush and rubbing compound.<P>then drenched the whole thing in TIRE SHINE!<P>took me about 6 hours on that one wheel...i didnt do the other 3 yet  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Question to anyone:<P>take a look at my decklid...isnt it supposed to have a bubble in the middle? Is this decklid original? It doesnt bother me, just wunderin.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>thanks<P>m0pe||||reg||10
